<item><title>Burundi&apos;s election commission rejects Rwasa&apos;s presidential bid</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-s-election-commission-rejects-rwasa-s-presidential-fff745/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-s-election-commission-rejects-rwasa-s-presidential-fff745/</guid><category>Burundi</category><description>The commission says he failed to prove he had been outside party politics for at least a year, while his representative plans an appeal.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:11:46 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-s-election-commission-rejects-rwasa-s-presidential-fff745/share.jpg" length="42464" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-s-election-commission-rejects-rwasa-s-presidential-fff745/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burundi’s communes urged to put youth jobs in annual budgets</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-s-communes-urged-to-put-youth-jobs-in-annual-budgets-a81de3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-s-communes-urged-to-put-youth-jobs-in-annual-budgets-a81de3/</guid><category>Burundi</category><description>Olucome’s secretary general says local authorities should work with communal councils to identify projects such as small industries and cooperatives.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:00:47 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" length="31311" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burundi communes face pressure to turn 22 billion FBu into youth jobs</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-communes-face-pressure-to-turn-22-billion-fbu-into-be40bd/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-communes-face-pressure-to-turn-22-billion-fbu-into-be40bd/</guid><category>Burundi</category><description>The 2026-27 budget sets aside 22 billion FBu for each commune, while young people describe scarce work and limited prospects.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:12:35 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" length="31311" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burundi cameraman Bonaventure Niyongabo released after several days in custody</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-cameraman-bonaventure-niyongabo-released-after-64587c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-cameraman-bonaventure-niyongabo-released-after-64587c/</guid><category>Burundi</category><description>Sources close to his family say the national rights commission intervened; authorities had not explained his detention or continued custody.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 04:14:24 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" length="31311" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Cholera infects at least 12 Saint-Marc students amid water shortage</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/cholera-infects-at-least-12-saint-marc-students-amid-water-846a40/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/cholera-infects-at-least-12-saint-marc-students-amid-water-846a40/</guid><category>Burundi</category><description>The boarding school in Bujumbura has reportedly lacked potable water for nearly two weeks, while parents say students cannot return home.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:52:36 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" length="31311" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
